AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:FOODON_00001172 "The default nut product is a whole, raw nut - meaning that the kernel is whole, and moderately or significantly dried, but not baked.  Minimal references to nuts often leave ambiguous whether the shell is on or off. \"I ate a peanut\" doesn't clarify whether I ate a shell-off nut or whether I did the shelling."@en)
