AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00001730 "Common chicory, Cichorium intybus, is a somewhat woody, perennial herbaceous plant of the dandelion family Asteraceae, usually with bright blue flowers, rarely white or pink."@en)
