AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_00001730 "Blue daisy, blue dandelion, blue sailors, blue weed, bunk, coffeeweed, cornflower, hendibeh, horseweed, ragged sailors, succory, wild bachelor's buttons, and wild endive.

Note: \"Cornflower\" is commonly applied to Centaurea cyanus.

Common names for varieties of var. foliosum include endive, radicchio, radichetta, Belgian endive, French endive, red endive, sugarloaf, and witloof (or witlof)."@en)
