AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002041 "Mineral water is water from a mineral spring that contains various minerals, such as salts and sulfur compounds. Mineral water may be classified as \"still\" or \"sparkling\" (carbonated/effervescent) according to the presence or absence of added gases."@en)
