AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:FOODON_00002429 "Damion Dooley"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_00002429 "\"Such food is usually ready to eat without further preparation. It may also be easily portable, have a long shelf life, or offer a combination of such convenient traits. Although restaurant meals meet this definition, the term is seldom applied to them. Convenience foods include ready-to-eat dry products, frozen foods such as TV dinners, shelf-stable foods, prepared mixes such as cake mix, and snack foods\". [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Convenience_food]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_00002429 "convenience food"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_00002429 obo:FOODON_00002373)

