AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002502 "Ham is pork from a leg cut that has been preserved by wet or dry curing, with or without smoking.  As a processed meat, the term \"ham\" includes both whole cuts of meat and ones that have been mechanically formed."@en)
