AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002509 "The Beurré Bosc or Bosc is a cultivar of the European Pear (Pyrus communis) from France or Belgium originally. Also known as the Kaiser , it is grown in Europe, Australia, British Columbia and Ontario, Canada, and the northwestern U.S. states of California, Washington, and Oregon;"@en)
