AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002545 "Serrano ham, or \"Jamón serrano\" in spanish, literally \"ham from the sierra, or mountain range\") is a type of dry-cured Spanish jamón (ham) which includes most varieties other than those made with black Iberian pigs (jamón ibérico)."@en)
