AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002546 "Iberian ham, is a type of cured ham produced in Spain and Portugal. According to Spain's denominación de origen rules on food products, jamón ibérico may be made from black Iberian pigs, or cross-bred pigs so long as they are at least 50% ibérico."@en)
