AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002738 "Meat and bone meal (MBM) is a product of the rendering industry. It is typically about 48–52% protein, 33–35% ash, 8–12% fat, and 4–7% water. It is primarily used in the formulation of animal feed to improve the amino acid profile of the feed."@en)
