AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002741 "A high-protein commodity used as a major component in some pet foods. It is made from grinding clean, rendered parts of poultry carcasses and can contain bones, offal and undeveloped eggs, but only contains feathers that are unavoidable in the processing of the poultry parts."@en)
