AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002833 "Duqqa is an Egyptian condiment consisting of a mixture of herbs, nuts (usually hazelnut), and spices. It is typically used as a dip with bread or fresh vegetables for an hors d'œuvre."@en)
