# Class: obo:FOODON_00002839 (akutaq)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002839 "A food in western Alaska and northern Canada, traditionally made with whipped fat mixed with berries like cranberries, salmonberries, crowberries, cloudberries and blueberries, fish, tundra greens, or roots with animal oil or fat. It may also include whitefish, caribou tallow, moose tallow, walrus tallow, or seal oil."@en)
