# Class: obo:FOODON_00002933 (hazelnut)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00002933 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002933 "The hazelnut is the nut of the hazel and therefore includes any of the nuts deriving from species of the genus Corylus, especially the nuts of the species Corylus avellana. It also is known as cobnut or filbert nut according to species."@en)
