AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00002940 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002940 "Instant noodles are a noodle dish sold in a precooked and dried noodle block, with flavoring powder and/or seasoning oil. The flavoring is usually in a separate packet, although in the case of cup noodles the flavoring is often loose in the cup.  Originally a Japanese product, instant noodles are now produced in many other markets."@en)
