AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_00003152 wikipedia:Brain_as_food)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000600 obo:FOODON_00003152 "The brain, like most other internal organs, or offal, can serve as nourishment. Brains used for nourishment include those of pigs, squirrels, rabbits, horses, cattle, monkeys, chickens, fish, lamb and goats. In many cultures, different types of brain are considered a delicacy.[wikipedia]"@en)
