* seed, skin removed, germ removed (endosperm) FOODON:03420208
* cooking with added fat or oil FOODON:03450025
* ingredient: flavoring, spice or herb added FOODON:03460227
* ingredient: vegetable fat or oil added FOODON:03460263"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03307020 "poppadum"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03307020 obo:FOODON_00001183)

