AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411361 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411361 "Succotash (from Narragansett sohquttahhash, \"broken corn kernels\") is a food dish consisting primarily of sweet corn with lima beans or other shell beans. Other ingredients may be added including tomatoes, green or sweet red peppers, and okra. Combining a grain with a legume provides a dish that is high in all essential amino acids."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03411361 wikipedia:Succotash)
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:FOODON_03411361 "Damion Dooley"@en)
