# Class: obo:FOODON_03420228 (extract, concentrate or isolate of plant or animal)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03420228 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03420228 "A physical-chemical component separated from the food source or its parts by extraction, centrifugation, filtration, heat processing, expressing or a similar process. The separated component may be converted through further processing. If this is done, the final substance is indexed. A water-extracted component may remain in aqueous dispersion. The extract, concentrate or isolate is indexed in preference to the anatomic part from which it is derived. For example, peanut oil is indexed under *PEANUT* combined wih *FAT OR OIL* rather than with *SEED OR KERNEL*. On the other hand, fruit and vegetable juices can be indexed under *FRUIT JUICE OR NECTAR* or *VEGETABLE JUICE* (A. PRODUCT TYPE); therefore the anatomic part of the plant should be indexed."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03420228 "langual:C0228")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03420228 "Damion Dooley's note: Items in this branch will be merged into foodon food product branch."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03420228 "extract, concentrate or isolate of plant or animal"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03420228 obo:FOODON_00001714)

