AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03460755 "Wheat malt is malted grain made of wheat. Malt is germinated cereal grain that has been dried in a process known as \"malting\". The grain is made to germinate by soaking in water and is then halted from germinating further by drying with hot air."@en)
